+| `GET /admin` | list page (`admin-list`), `page` 1-based, 50 rows/page + Older detector |
+| `GET /admin/rows` | rows fragment ONLY for `HX-Request` (root `id="rows"`); else 303 `/admin?page=N` |
+| `GET /admin/walk` | walk page with a fresh CSRF token + bbox |
+| `GET /admin/lights/{id}` | detail/edit page; `ErrNotFound` → 404; `#light-pos` at 6 dp |
+| `POST /admin/lights` | `LimitBody` first, parse → CSRF → validate → bbox 422 → photo 413/415 → duplicates; numbered: Merge + Cancel; unnumbered: Merge + Save anyway (numbered+save 422); merge applies label AND photo atomically; success → role=status `Saved` (HX) / 303 `/admin` |
+| `POST /admin/lights/{id}` | edit (label, asset_no; unspecified fields keep values) → 303 detail |
+| `POST /admin/lights/{id}/delete` | soft delete → 303 `/admin` |
+
+## Template inventory
+
+Pages: `pages/admin-walk.html`, `pages/admin-list.html`,
+`pages/admin-detail.html`, `pages/admin-login.html`.
+Partials: `partials/admin-rows.html`, `partials/admin-dup.html`,
+`partials/admin-alert.html`.
+`base.html`, `pages/index.html`, `partials/probe.html` untouched.
+
+JS: `web/static/js/walk.js` (200 lines, `// @ts-check`, ES module, no
+`console.log`) + `web/static/js/globals.d.ts`.
+
+## Verification (this attempt, exit codes)
+
+| Command | Exit | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| `make check-fast` | 0 | fmt-check, vet, golangci-lint 0 issues, `go test -race -shuffle` all green |
+| `make templates-check` | 0 | `TestRenderAll` snapshots + `npx html-validate testdata/rendered` |
+| `make js-check` | 0 | `tsc --noEmit` strict checkJs |
+| `make build` | 0 | `bin/server` |
+| `make e2e-task TASK=T-205` | 0 | grep pattern printed, **0 tests executed** (only inert `.txt` drafts; T-207 activates them) |
+| `npx playwright test --grep "@A-2"` | 1 | **No tests found** — no activated admin specs exist in this branch. This is NOT presented as verification. |
+| scratch visual flow (packet-sanctioned, deleted before commit) | 0 | 1/1 pixel-9, 1/1 iphone-se-320; see screenshots below. |
+
+The only claims oracle available before T-207 is the frozen drafts plus the
+packet. The scratch spec drove the real server + real store + real photo
+pipeline and asserted: 6-dp `#walk-pos`/`#pin-pos`, `accuracy 8 m`, enabled
+`Add light here`, CSRF form, portrait-orient6 preview intrinsic width > height,
+success `Saved`, list alt `GP-017 Ball field lamp`, numbered `#dup-panel` with
+the existing label/asset/distance, merge leaves one row with the twin label,
+detail `#light-pos` 6 dp and a landscape detail photo, no horizontal overflow,
+44×44 minimum for buttons/inputs/selects/pin, and attribution visible.
+
+## Visual evidence (kept under `test-results/`, gitignored)
+
+- `test-results/t205-walk-{pixel-9,iphone-se-320}.png`
+- `test-results/t205-dup-{pixel-9,iphone-se-320}.png`
+- `test-results/t205-list-{pixel-9,iphone-se-320}.png`
+- `test-results/t205-detail-{pixel-9,iphone-se-320}.png`
