+is no horizontal overflow at 320 px; attribution is visible on every page.
+
+## Open issues / notes
+
+1. **`npx playwright test --grep "@A-2"` has no runnable specs yet.** The four
+   claim specs are inert `.txt` drafts by design; T-207 activates them. The
+   scratch run above is visual/handler evidence, not a substitute for those
